IHrmPlatformActivityLog.description:
Full activity log entry capturing a specific organizational governance event, including {

link actionType}, target entity details, acting member information, and event timestamp.

Activity logs are immutable, append-only records that maintain complete governance history for audit compliance. Each entry records actions such as employee lifecycle changes, contract modifications, project transitions, task status updates, timesheet workflow events, and role assignments.

The {

link member} reference identifies who performed the action, while {

link entityType} and {

link entityId} form a polymorphic reference to the affected resource. Action-specific metadata is stored in {

link activityLogDetails} as structured key-value pairs maintaining 1NF compliance.
